agent: **Here is a proposed starting point for your decision:**
  **Decision:** Scheduled Pipeline Restock Job
  **Why:** A weekly scheduled pipeline job queries stock levels and sends one alert listing items at or below their reorder point. It removes the manual weekly check and uses the preferred GitHub Actions platform.
  **Architecture:** This decision stands on its own and a new architecture will follow.
  **Alternatives:**
